### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\ln(\sqrt{x})\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=\sqrt{x}\text{, }v(x)=\ln(x)}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{\dfrac1{\sqrt{x}}}\cdot \maroonC{\dfrac1{2\sqrt{x}}}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{1}{2x}
\end{align}$
